{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢2015年よりも進化した北野日奈子2016verです。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！26回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nげすぱさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて撮った角度"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと面白い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウェーブヘア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆左胸のバレッタさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁チップの好きな食べ物はなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎チーズと甘いものと牛乳！\n主に乳製品と甘いもの！\n時々しろみときみのチーズも横取りしてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あつきさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁麺類最強ってしってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎なに！知らない！おしえて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆けんしょうさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁絶対に食べられない食べ物なにかある？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ゲテモノ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆こーきさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんって妹と歳近いんだね\n絵だと同じショートカットになってるけどいろんな人によく似てるねとか言われるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎最近言われるようになった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんも妹も日奈子も\nみんなボブなんだ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆タッキーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁最近、あしゅとはどうですか？(笑)またツーショット見たいです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎今日会ったけど、ずっと一緒にいたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ちゃんといると落ち着く！\n飛鳥ちゃんともっと一緒にいたい！\n飛鳥ちゃんってとても優しいんだけど\nさりげなく優しくしてくれるの。\n泣けてくるよね、だいすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日経エンタテインメント！\n発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんとかりんと未央奈と私で\n2期生のことについて語りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46クリエイター座談会コーナーで\n丸山監督が私と飛鳥ちんの話しをして下さっていて、となりに座って2人でウキウキしながら読んでました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16年はじまりました。\n皆さんついてきてください。見ていてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ゆー今年こそは痩せるさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁2年ぶりに札幌に帰省してるんだけど、会社とか友達に北海道土産を何にするか悩んでます！\nきいちゃんのおすすめとかあったら教えてほしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎大平原！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆グレムリンさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今年はどこかに初詣に行きましたか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎毎年行く鹿島神宮に家族で初詣にいきました！お願い事も書いてきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族皆んなのことで、文もみんなで考えた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナコセレクト(仮)は\nここでおわりです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやります(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族になった日のしろみときみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/06/9237767/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n19回目はぢらふ。さんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今年ももう359日しか残ってないですねぇ。」"}],"source":"archive"}